{"resourceIdentifier":"3875","resourceName":"FUTURE GREEN CARBON PROJECT","description":"Future Green Carbon Project is an AFOLU initiative to be implemented in the Central West\r\nregion of Brazil, specifically in the state of Mato Grosso do Sul (MS). It is a voluntary action of\r\nEldorado Brasil Celulose S/A, aiming at the reforestation of more than\r\n100,000 hectares with new and additional eucalyptus plantations , established exclusively on\r\nnon forested and anthropized areas . In addition to the creation of carbon stocks through\r\nreforestation activities for production purposes , the project will also enable the recovery and\r\nconservation of carbon stocks based on native species for conservation purposes. Even tho ugh\r\nthe restoration of such areas will be enabled by the project, resulting in direct climate benefits,\r\nVCUs will not be claimed for such activities.","location":{"latitude":-20.772230,"longitude":-54.785153},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-07","endExclusive":"2023-10-08","endInclusive":"2023-10-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3875"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"MS"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Eldorado Brasil Celulose S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo, Brazil"},{"type":"string","value":"+55 11 2505-0200"},{"type":"string","value":"sustentabilidade@eldoradobrasil.com.br"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Rejected by Administrator"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1358351"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-AC